  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farm Africa: 2023-2026: Nature-Based Solutions for Sustainable Development</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Farm Africa: 2023-2026: Nature-Based Solutions for Sustainable Development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall objective of the  programme is to contribute to environmental sustainability, climate resilience and inclusive development in Ethiopia. The goal will be achieved through five mutually reinforcing outcomes as follows:
Outcome 1: Improved natural resources, biodiversity and ecosystem services.
Outcome 2: Improved sustainable food and nutrition security.
Outcome 3: Enhanced inclusive livelihood development.
Outcome 4: Increased climate adaptation and mitigation.
Outcome 5: Reduced resource-based conflicts through gender-sensitive inter-community peace and conflict resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Det f&#xf6;reslagna programmets &#xf6;vergripande m&#xe5;l att bidra till milj&#xf6;m&#xe4;ssig h&#xe5;llbarhet, klimatmotst&#xe5;ndskraft och inkluderande utveckling genom att leverera f&#xf6;ljande &#xf6;vergripande resultat:
1. F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrade naturresurser, biologisk m&#xe5;ngfald och ekosystemtj&#xe4;nster. 
2. F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad h&#xe5;llbar livsmedels&#xad; och n&#xe4;ringstrygghet. 
3. F&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttrad utveckling av inkluderande f&#xf6;rs&#xf6;rjningsm&#xf6;jligheter. 
4. &#xd6;kad klimatanpassning och utsl&#xe4;ppsbegr&#xe4;nsning. 
5. Minskade konflikter om naturresurser genom j&#xe4;mst&#xe4;lldhetsintegrerad freds- och konfliktl&#xf6;sning mellan olika befolkningsgrupper</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To contribute to environmental sustainability, climate resilience and inclusive development in Ethiopia.
The programme will  aim to achieve the following five interlinked results;
1: Improved natural resources, biodiversity and ecosystem services.
2: Improved sustainable food and nutrition security.
3: Enhanced inclusive livelihood development.
4: Increased climate adaptation and mitigation.
5: Reduced resource&#xad;based conflicts through gender&#xad;sensitive inter&#xad;community
peace and conflict resolution.</narrative>
  </description>
